  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gtb Soc Work 08</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gtb Uni Soc arb 08</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">G&#xF6;teborgs universitet/institutionen f&#xF6;r socialt h&#xE5;ller i samarbete med universitetet i Havanna en internationell forskningskonferens med m&#xE5;let att unders&#xF6;ka f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningarna f&#xF6;r att presentera h&#xE5;llbara, och genomt&#xE4;nkta f&#xF6;rslag till gemensamma, komparativa forskningsprojekt som kan leda till v&#xE4;lutbildade kubanska socialarbetare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The institution for Social Work at the University of Gothenburg is together with the University of Havana gathering an international research conference. The purpose is to investigate the preconditions for presenting sustainable and well-defined proposals for common, comparative research projects which can lead to well-educated Cuban social workers.</narrative>
  </description>
